    "featuredImage": "/images/documents/travel-insurance.jpeg",
    "publishedAt": "2026-01-10T00:00:00+00:00",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "content": "## Why Travel Insurance is Mandatory\n\nTravel insurance isn't optional for Schengen visa applications - it's a strict requirement. The Schengen Visa Code requires all applicants to have adequate travel medical insurance as a condition for visa issuance.\n\nThis requirement protects both you and the Schengen countries from medical costs during your stay.\n\n---\n\n## Minimum Requirements\n\n### Coverage Amount\n- **Minimum:** €30,000 (or equivalent)\n- **Recommended:** €50,000+ for better protection\n\n### Geographic Coverage\n- Must be valid in **all 29 Schengen countries**\n- Including countries you're not planning to visit\n- Pan-Schengen or worldwide policies work\n\n### Duration\n- Must cover **entire duration** of your stay\n- From arrival date to departure date\n- Add a few extra days for safety\n\n### What Must Be Covered\n\n**Mandatory Coverage:**\n1. **Medical emergencies** - Illness, accidents\n2. **Hospital treatment** - Inpatient and outpatient\n3. **Emergency medical evacuation** - Transport to hospital\n4. **Repatriation of remains** - In case of death\n5. **Urgent return home** - Family emergency coverage\n\n**Recommended Additional Coverage:**\n- Trip cancellation\n- Lost luggage\n- Flight delays\n- Personal liability\n- Legal assistance\n\n---\n\n## Cost Estimates\n\nPrices vary based on age, trip length, and coverage:\n\n### By Trip Duration\n\n| Duration | Budget Policy | Standard Policy | Premium Policy |\n|----------|--------------|-----------------|----------------|\n| 1 week | €10-15 | €15-25 | €30-50 |\n| 2 weeks | €15-25 | €25-40 | €50-80 |\n| 1 month | €25-40 | €40-70 | €80-150 |\n| 3 months | €60-100 | €100-180 | €200-350 |\n\n### By Age Group\n\n| Age | Premium Increase |\n|-----|------------------|\n| 18-35 | Base rate |\n| 36-50 | +10-20% |\n| 51-65 | +30-50% |\n| 66-75 | +80-150% |\n| 75+ | May need specialist provider |\n\n---\n\n## Where to Buy\n\n### Insurance Companies\n\nMany international insurance companies offer Schengen-compliant policies:\n\n**Global Providers:**\n- Allianz Global Assistance\n- AXA Assistance\n- Europ Assistance\n- Mondial Assistance\n- Generali Global Assistance\n\n**Online Platforms:**\n- World Nomads\n- SafetyWing\n- Battleface\n- Heymondo\n- IATI Seguros\n\n---\n\n## Ready to Apply?\n\nDon't let insurance be a roadblock. Our team helps you choose the right policy and ensures it meets all Schengen requirements.\n\n**Start your visa application today!**",
